For a **3–5 years React.js Frontend Developer** interview, companies (product-based, fintech, SaaS, FAANG, startups) expect much more than React APIs. They evaluate how well you understand JavaScript, React internals, performance, architecture, browser behavior, rendering, state management, testing, accessibility, and system design.

Below is a **complete React Frontend Interview Roadmap** organized exactly like an interview syllabus. It includes almost every topic repeatedly asked in interviews.

